    "findings/resources/vsfan-extracted-assets.md",
    8,
    "- Root APK: `com-vshower-prd-sr-1441-39567016-ef64fd3f499bd158a709f4c380d3c06d.apk`. Android `aapt dump badging` identifies package `com.vshower.prd_sr`, version code `1441`, version name `1.4.4.1`, min SDK 16, target SDK 26. SHA-256: `0fbd1e08dc6e0dbdf9ecf972552c9de52fc4fd86b4b573af52935e8296199f4a`. Its ZIP has 877 entries including 52 `.jet` payloads; named game packages include `C001`, `C003`,"
   ],
   [
    "findings/resources/vsfan-extracted-assets.md",
    86,
    "- **APK 1.4.4.1 families:** character resources C001/C003/C009/C010 and related effect/sound, shared character rigs/cut-ins (`CE_PUB`, `CFE_PUB`, `CHA_AT`, `SKE_PUB`, `WAG_PUB`, `UI_CHA_RANK_NEW`); monster art packages M001, M002, M005, M006, M008, M009, M100; stage/background families `ST001`, `SNOW`, `STORY_TUTO`, and UI/tutorial/effect packages. File tree contains 110 small motion XML/JSON defi"
   ],
   [
    "findings/resources/vsfan-extracted-assets.md",
    101,
    "- **Monsters:** art/animation resource groups exist for M001, M002, M005, M006, M008, M009 and M100. The directories contain visual resources, not max-HP/ATK/DEF records or a mapping from a screen HUD number to a base stat."
   ],
   [
    "findings/revival/vsfan-material-index.md",
    18,
    "- Visual/resource families include Blustone hunter portraits, NPCs, locations and limited monster art for M001/M002/M005/M006/M008/M009/M100. None yields a source-backed monster HP/ATK/DEF row. The screenshot/video audit found identity and UI context, not new base-stat tuples."
   ],
