    "findings/episodes/episode02-material-closure.md",
    29,
    "Entry requires voice8 for Lana. Story02 additionally DIAL_BG9/C007_SND/C032_SND. Story03 requires Bright C049 family/C054_SND/ST002 and original BG001_3 from DIAL_BG; M023 already in M008. Story05 adds N500/N501/voice5/M017/M021. Stories07/08 add CUT_E0201/voice9/N002 for N002_BG. Sound-only C007/C032/C054 references do not justify complete art/effect families. No C049A/B variants or owned Bright "
